Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=89}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:01:52.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those three think they can mock me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.47,0:01:53.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Screw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:57.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I consider this act of\Naggression a declaration of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:01.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There you are, Mohji.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.85,0:02:06.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope you wouldn't mind if\NI take the Pirate Hunter's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.27,0:02:08.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.12,0:02:19.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.79,0:02:22.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:23.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.83,0:02:27.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's with this dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:29.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:38.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro, it looks like this dog is frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:39.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.64,0:02:43.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He could sit there\Nforever, for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:44.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:56.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get off! Get off! Get off! Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:01.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, please, quit goofing\Naround and get serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:05.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't feel good...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:11.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:13.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! Hi, navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:15.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess you can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:17.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You got me out of a\Npretty sticky situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.89,0:03:20.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great! The key to the cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:22.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you go and steal if for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:24.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.31,0:03:25.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I only did it so we'd be even.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:28.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:43.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid, stupid dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:46.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give it back!\NThat's not yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:47.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give me my key!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:49.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give it! Give it! Give it! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:51.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:52.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:55.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop picking on poor Chouchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:56.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And who might you be old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:03.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Old man? Why, I'm the\Nmayor of this town!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:05.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are {\i1}you{\i0} and why are\Nyou hurting Chouchou? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:14.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How's Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:19.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I told him he really should see a doctor,\Nbut he insisted that he didn't need to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:20.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and just wanted to sleep it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:24.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,dog's name is Chouchou?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:28.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why is he just sitting there like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:30.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He sure is a lazy dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:32.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's guarding the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:36.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! I see. It's a pet food shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:38.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:42.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the man who used to run this\Nstore was a very close friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:48.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There ya' go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:55.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}When he passed, I assumed the responsibility\Nof taking care of Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:56.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He died?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:58.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:03.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three months ago, after fighting\Nhis illness for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.07,0:05:08.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's been waiting for\Nhis master to return all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.08,0:05:10.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That seems to be the consensus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.25,0:05:14.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:21.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I find that very hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.13,0:05:23.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chouchou is a smart dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:28.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's probably known for a while\Nthat his master isn't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:34.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then... why does he\Nstay here at the store?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:37.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess because he has\Na connection to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.36,0:05:39.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's his... treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:40.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's guarding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:45.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His master left him with this shop\Nand that's why he protects it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:49.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I've tried to bring him back to my place,\Nso he won't be out in the elements,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.08,0:05:52.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but he won't take so much\Nas a step away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:08.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:09.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.72,0:06:12.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beast Tamer Mohji! We gotta go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:15.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by "Beast Tamer"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:18.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Wait! Hold On!\N– Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon puppy, something's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:22.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just\Ngive me that key back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.91,0:06:24.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:29.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see that your friends\Nhave deserted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:31.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And after you just escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:35.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm known as the "Beast Tamer Mohji,"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:37.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a member of the Buggy Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:40.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's a weird\Nanimal suit you got on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:42.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.47,0:06:43.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is manly hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:45.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'K, That's even weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:49.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't assume that you're safe\Njust because you're in that cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:51.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must not know of\Nmy terrifying skill!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:53.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There is no animal in this world
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:57.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that Beast Tamer Mohji\Ncan't bend to do his bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.94,0:06:59.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shake...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:02.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why does it hurt so bad?!
