Comment: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:02.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=40}END OUCH
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:05.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You nameless thief, I've\Nno interest in killing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.91,0:07:10.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But tell me where Roronoa Zoro\Nis before I change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:13.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Richie, Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:19.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! I'm finally out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:26.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:28.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good boy, Richie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:33.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now let's go find Zoro so I can defeat\Nhim and strengthen my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.27,0:07:34.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's, wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:38.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a pet food store.\NMake it quick, then let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:41.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:47.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me this pathetic little thing\Nreally thinks he can guard the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:52.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whew, that was intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:55.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At least now, I'm out of that cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:57.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He.He.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:08:02.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Now, first thing, I teach those Buggy\NPirates a lesson and then I convince Nami
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:04.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to be the navigator for my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:04.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.92,0:08:06.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How'd you survive that attack?!
