Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:06.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(814,1053)}You're alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.84,0:08:06.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(757,1053)}You're alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:06.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(728,1053)}You're alive?!
Comment: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:06.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=66}STOP - You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:07.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just got lucky, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:11.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Surviving an attack\Nlike that isn't normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:14.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd be scattered all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.39,0:08:15.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:18.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why exactly did you decide\Nto come to this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.73,0:08:20.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and how'd you get involved\Nwith those pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:23.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All I'm doing is searching\Nfor a chart of the Grand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:26.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and a good navigator\Nto join my pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:32.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I think that guy in the animal suit said\Nhe was looking for Zoro, so, I gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:47.84,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Chouchou? This shop\Nbelongs to the two of us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:56.56,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha. Ha. That bag is way\Ntoo big for you, Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:15.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Chouchou.\NDon't hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.03,0:09:16.54,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:20.37,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Bad Chouchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:22.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you not to eat the merchandise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:24.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, let's chow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:38.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... Not ready to give up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:42.98,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Chouchou, I'm getting on in years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.98,0:09:45.15,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I gotta go see the\Ndoctor for a checkup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.15,0:09:48.90,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,But I'll be back, so guard\Nthe shop until I return.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:52.78,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:54.78,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(62,0,1,\c&HEFF2F2&\3c&HEFF2F2&\4c&HEFF2F2&)}Hold down the fort!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.27,0:10:24.48,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That tickles, Chouchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:32.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,He has a connection to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.95,0:10:34.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's his treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:35.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,He's guarding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:39.99,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,His master left him with this shop\Nand that's why he protects it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:05.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:07.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that\Nannoying little dog bit {\i1}me{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:19.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, I thought I killed you.\NWhat are you still doing alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:24.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you can't get\Nrid of me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:27.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This time crush his head\Ninto the ground, Richie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:34.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be beaten by a lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:36.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:41.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:57.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... I ate the Gum-Gum Devil Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:59.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So then you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:03.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... Devil Fruit powers like Captain\NBuggy, but yours make you rubber?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:09.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I apologize for attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:11.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't want any trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:14.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no reason\Nfor you to apologize to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.13,0:12:17.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because of you, that dog will\Nnever get his treasure back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:23.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now... because of that,\NI'm gonna kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:49.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're all just a bunch\Nof heartless bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:52.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They destroy everything\Nthat people hold dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:54.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,without giving it a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:56.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're alive, Pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:58.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, I thought\Nfor sure that lion
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:00.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was gonna tear your\Nhead off and end it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I wish he had, 'cause then there'd\Nbe one less pirate in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:07.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should kill you right\Nnow before you can gather a crew
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.81,0:13:09.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and destroy everything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.39,0:13:12.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come now, there's no need for violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:13.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As if you could ever kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I'll try it and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.19,0:13:16.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:18.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's with you people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:29.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:32.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's all\Nthat I could save for ya'.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.63,0:13:36.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That bastard lion ate\Nall the rest of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:38.42,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:42.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He fought the lion...\Nin order to save the dog's food?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:47.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fought well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.51,0:13:50.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Course I didn't actually\Nsee you defend the store,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:52.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I can tell you gave it your all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.41,0:14:11.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.58,0:14:13.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good luck to you, too, doggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:30.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were defeated?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.27,0:14:31.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:33.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm very sorry, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.27,0:14:35.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:38.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mohji, I can't believe you\Nwere defeated by Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:40.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:41.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was that straw hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:42.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:45.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way that skinny little punk\Ncould have gotten the better of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.66,0:14:47.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's eaten the Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:49.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really pissed off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:52.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, Prepare all the\Nremaining Special Buggy Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:55.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blow this entire,\Nmiserable town to smithereens!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.88,0:15:00.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to yell at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:04.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's okay, you've been\Nunder a lot of stress lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.93,0:15:09.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But hey, no need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:10.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:13.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chouchou and this young\None have fought so hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.52,0:15:16.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and yet I, the mayor, have done\Nnothing but sit back and watch
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:19.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,our town be obliterated by\NBuggy and his despicable crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:21.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Calm down! It's not that bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:26.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forty years ago, this whole area\Nwas nothing but barren, rugged land.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:29.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We all worked together to\Ncreate fields for our crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.62,0:15:32.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We opened stores, and built\Neverything from the ground up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:36.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This town is a treasure\Nto me and all its citizens!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:41.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}From here on out, I refuse to let Buggy\Nand his crew terrorize us any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:43.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire a Special Buggy Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:45.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Blow this town away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:15:59.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'll destroy it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:16:01.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Zoro was sleeping in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.61,0:16:04.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you in there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:08.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.41,0:16:10.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's one hell of\Na way to wake a guy up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:17.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I coulda used a few more z's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:20.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How did {\i1}you{\i0} survive that blast?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:22.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right! You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:26.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let him get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:28.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't stand for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:30.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't let this scumbag destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:33.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,all that my townspeople worked\Nfor these last forty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.60,0:16:39.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am the mayor of this town!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:42.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will protect it and it's inhabitants!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:44.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I swear... to my dying breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.94,0:16:46.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop! You can't defeat Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:50.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perhaps... but there are some\Nfights that a man can't run from!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.53,0:16:51.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:53.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.99,0:16:55.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Don't egg him on, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.99,0:16:58.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous for him to fight Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:00.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know that it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:07.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, Buggy the Clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.80,0:17:10.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The mayor was crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:12.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was? Huh, I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:14.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like the\Nparty's getting more exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.85,0:17:18.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:20.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is no time for laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:23.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I started to\Ngrow fond of that old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:25.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd let him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:28.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:29.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna go too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.53,0:17:30.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're wounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:32.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.03,0:17:36.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the injury to my reputation's a lot\Nworse than the injury to my gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:42.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, if we want to get to the Grand Line...\Nwe better go steal that chart back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:45.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! Are you gonna\Njoin our crew or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:46.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:47.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.34,0:17:50.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll never sink so low\Nas to become a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:56.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I suppose we could team up,\Nin order to achieve our common goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.56,0:17:59.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The second shot is ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:01.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right then, fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:04.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come out, Buggy the Clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:10.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm Mayor Boodle and this\Ntown is my treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.03,0:18:14.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let you terrorize my people\Nany longer, so come out and fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiot! This town is no treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:18.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Treasure is gold, silver, and jewelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.99,0:18:22.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So cut the crap, old man,\Nand get outta here before I kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:24.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You could never understand how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:30.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Soon I'm going to conquer the Grand Line\Nand flashily obtain all the world's riches,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:32.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and there's nothing\Nyou can do to stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:34.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All the world will belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, if this town means so much to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:39.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then perhaps I'll do you a\Nfavor and kill you first,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.22,0:18:42.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that way you won't have to see\Nme destroy your precious village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:46.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up... and fight me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.69,0:18:51.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll never let you destroy this town,\Nif it costs me my very life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.74,0:18:53.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:59.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That straw hat! Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:07.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm here to kick your ass, just\Nlike I promised I would, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:17.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:20.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't just waltz up to\Nme and treat me like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.68,0:19:23.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm Captain Buggy\Nand I won't stand for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.81,0:19:25.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, all I want is the chart
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.81,0:19:28.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and the treasure then I'm\Nout of here, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:29.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.77,0:19:33.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get outta here. Why'd you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're outsiders, leave\Nthis to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:42.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is {\i1}my{\i0} fight that I need\Nto be the one to protect my town!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.75,0:19:47.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buggy is my fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:53.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:58.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you\Nthink you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:20:00.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why'd you knock out the mayor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:02.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.52,0:20:05.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:08.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If the old man had continued\Nto fight he would have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:09.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:12.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to hit him!\NI'm sure we could have
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:15.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,thought of a more humane way\Nto deal with the situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:28.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the worst thing you\Ncould have said to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:31.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ohh... You damn flashy idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:34.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't stand for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take aim and fire the Buggy Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:40.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:41.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on Luffy, we gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:42.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:44.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:46.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.77,0:20:51.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.19,0:20:56.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What {\i1}is{\i0} he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:20:58.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did he catch the Buggy Ball?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:02.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.57,0:21:04.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He coulda warned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:14.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right! I got 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:16.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell kinda monster are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think you freaked her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:30.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew that something was weird after\Nyou survived the fight with that lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.19,0:21:32.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No human being can do what you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:33.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now explain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:37.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell was the balloon\Ninflatey thing that you did just now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.32,0:21:39.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was the Gum-Gum Balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:41.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you call it,\Njust tell me how you did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.70,0:21:43.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you, some kind of freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.24,0:21:48.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you try to flashily do me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.21,0:21:54.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unreal...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:56.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Using his men as a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:04.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.59,0:22:06.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What in the world just happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.31,0:22:11.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:12.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.56,0:22:14.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's that damn Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:17.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy! We have to be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:19.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He has Devil Fruit powers, too!\NHe's a rubber person!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.73,0:22:21.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I saw it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.15,0:22:22.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.49,0:22:23.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rubber person?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.61,0:22:25.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... See?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.41,0:22:28.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.16,0:22:32.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That explains how he bounced\Nthat Buggy Ball back at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.50,0:22:33.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.63,0:22:40.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How do you plan to respond\Nto this insult... Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.55,0:22:43.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, Cabaji... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.43,0:22:45.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm too angry to even fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.51,0:22:46.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Put him down, Cabaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.76,0:22:48.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to my Richie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.97,0:22:50.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:53.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I used it as a shield, to keep\Nmy clothes from getting dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.98,0:22:56.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Richie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.44,0:22:59.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, Richie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.36,0:23:00.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say something, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:01.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Richie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.53,0:23:07.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Richie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.37,0:23:10.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.91,0:23:13.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:16.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How about... Outta {\i1}my{\i0} way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:29.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You may call me Acrobat Cabaji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.35,0:23:31.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy's Chief of Staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.77,0:23:34.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You will pay for your insolence!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.65,0:23:37.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll clash swords with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.69,0:23:42.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's an honor, Roronoa Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.57,0:23:47.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As a swordsman myself, I relish\Nthis chance to slay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:49.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.24,0:23:50.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.33,0:23:52.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You really should get some rest.\NLet me handle this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.95,0:23:54.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.96,0:23:57.50,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the stab wound\Nthe Captain inflicted on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.50,0:23:58.96,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,The fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.96,0:24:01.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Arsonist... Technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.22,0:24:12.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.43,0:24:14.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't kick you that hard, now did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.93,0:24:15.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He fights dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.93,0:24:18.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Going after his injury like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.56,0:24:22.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Acrobat Technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.27,0:24:24.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Murder at the Steam Bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.32,0:24:29.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Acrobat my ass. That's just\Nan ordinary dust cloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.33,0:24:36.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He did it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.58,0:24:39.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.92,0:24:43.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's such a disgraceful sight\Nto see a grown man moaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.50,0:24:49.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I suppose now you can see how foolish it\Nwas to make an enemy of the Buggy Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.89,0:24:52.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's hurt so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:55.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know how he's\Nmanaging to stay in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.43,0:24:57.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you just standing\Nthere watching him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.39,0:24:59.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's gonna get himself\Nkilled, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.48,0:25:10.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro... is finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.11,0:25:12.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You annoying little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.74,0:25:17.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You havin' fun pokin' at my wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.04,0:25:19.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.13,0:25:25.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ouchie!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.88,0:25:27.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.59,0:25:30.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... Why didn't you dodge his attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.22,0:25:33.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that enough of a handicap for ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.51,0:25:40.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now let me show you, just how\Nsuperior my skills are to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.44,0:25:43.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Zoro! Get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.61,0:25:47.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fool, you've made\Na vast error in judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.23,0:25:49.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't be mocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.07,0:25:52.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My swords aim to\Nbe the world's greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.78,0:25:58.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I refuse to lose even once to anyone\Nwho calls himself a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.08,0:25:59.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.75,0:26:03.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A strong resolve keeps\Nyou going. But have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.63,0:26:08.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wounds as bad as yours will be\Nmore than enough of an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.55,0:26:12.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For losing to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.01,0:26:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To hell with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.14,0:26:19.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I lose to someone like you,\Neven with these minimal injuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.35,0:26:22.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then I don't have a very\Nbright future ahead of me do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.23,0:26:25.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.56,0:26:27.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.78,0:26:31.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't stay and watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.53,0:26:34.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You pirates can stand\Naround for the rest of time
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.45,0:26:36.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and kill each other for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.53,0:26:40.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean it doesn't matter to me\Nwhether you guys win or lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.54,0:26:44.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm gonna take this opportunity to swipe\Ntheir treasure and get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.67,0:26:46.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.42,0:26:49.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can team up again\Nif we ever get the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.34,0:26:50.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.26,0:26:51.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good luck with the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.46,0:26:53.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks! See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.68,0:26:56.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here's a taste of\Nmy ultimate acrobatic move!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.22,0:27:01.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Acrobat Technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.64,0:27:04.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The Dance of a Hundred Kamikaze Tops!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.73,0:27:10.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Acrobat Technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.86,0:27:12.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A Hike in the Mountains!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.24,0:27:13.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.24,0:27:16.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fireworks in the Cool Summer Breeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.24,0:27:18.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's high!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.37,0:27:21.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sting of the Unicycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.49,0:27:23.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ground-Hugging...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.00,0:27:24.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Chop-Chop Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.50,0:27:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cabaji, I'll hold him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.67,0:27:31.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then you finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.25,0:27:32.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.97,0:27:35.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.02,0:27:43.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.14,0:27:46.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.19,0:27:50.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you wanna fight\Nsomeone... how about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.07,0:27:55.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I assure you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.74,0:27:58.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't need my Captain's\Nhelp to finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.66,0:28:02.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough... I'm tired of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.41,0:28:07.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you've finally given up, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.42,0:28:09.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must say, I'm quite\Nimpressed that you lasted
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.75,0:28:12.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that long with such serious injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.00,0:28:13.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think you misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.63,0:28:16.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of watching your\Nboring little side show.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.97,0:28:22.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So sorry to have disappointed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.68,0:28:24.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How about...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.93,0:28:26.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My {\i1}real{\i0} swordman skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.31,0:28:28.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.94,0:28:30.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Die, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.44,0:28:33.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Oni...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.69,0:28:34.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Giri!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.28,0:28:40.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cabaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.28,0:28:43.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.24,0:28:44.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the Buggy Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.41,0:28:46.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,were defeated by petty thieves.
Comment: 0,0:28:46.96,0:28:49.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[hit ground]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.50,0:28:53.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We aren't petty thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.84,0:28:58.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.13,0:29:02.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...\NI'm going to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.97,0:29:05.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good! I'm looking forward to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.73,0:29:12.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys are pirates?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.65,0:29:14.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.44,0:29:17.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're searching for the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.15,0:29:19.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! That's not an easy\Nvoyage, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.86,0:29:23.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I don't think that two halfwits\Nthe likes of you can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.28,0:29:26.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And what will you do if, by some\Nmiracle, you manage to make it there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.91,0:29:30.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go on a sightseeing tour\Nor something?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.79,0:29:35.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.71,0:29:38.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.84,0:29:42.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you were King of the Pirates,\Nthen that would make me God!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.64,0:29:44.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's only one who can\Nbe King of the Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.80,0:29:48.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and obtain all this world's treasures,\Nand that's gonna be me, you got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.93,0:29:51.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.10,0:29:53.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go ahead and settle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.77,0:29:58.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seeing that straw hat\Nbrings back memories of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.36,0:30:00.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and that really gets my blood boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.15,0:30:02.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So bring it on, you wannabe pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.82,0:30:04.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You remind me of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.91,0:30:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That damn cheeky red-haired pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.99,0:30:09.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.12,0:30:10.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The red hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.96,0:30:13.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you saying you\Nknew my old friend, Shanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.96,0:30:16.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right. I knew Shanks once.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.84,0:30:18.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know where he is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.21,0:30:19.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.21,0:30:21.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess that depends, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.09,0:30:24.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe I do and maybe I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.43,0:30:25.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.97,0:30:27.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.10,0:30:29.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't forget, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.39,0:30:33.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I'm not just gonna tell you where\Nhe is outta the kindness of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.23,0:30:35.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to work for that info!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.77,0:30:37.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine! I'll make you tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.82,0:30:42.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can give it your best shot,\Nbut I don't like your chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.74,0:30:46.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I doubt rubber can\Nbounce back from a blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.03,0:30:47.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.62,0:30:54.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Chop-Chop Rice Cracker!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.75,0:30:58.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't move in midair, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.96,0:31:00.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.46,0:31:02.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.55,0:31:08.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha. Ha. Oh, how interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.64,0:31:13.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not so bad either,\Nbut here comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.14,0:31:16.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.02,0:31:17.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're neat abilities all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.77,0:31:21.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but they leave you wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.53,0:31:23.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll carve you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.07,0:31:23.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.78,0:31:25.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Chop-Chop Quick Escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.11,0:31:27.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(150,150)}Sickle!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.16,0:31:28.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.50,0:31:36.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not good enough, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.54,0:31:40.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.09,0:31:44.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn, you keep breaking into pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.26,0:31:44.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.97,0:31:47.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're still going at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.05,0:31:48.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.80,0:31:51.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.81,0:31:54.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You dumbass, Pretend\Nyou're still knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.64,0:31:56.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you get yourself caught\Nin the middle of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.77,0:31:59.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then there's no way you'll\Never make it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.77,0:32:01.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Chop-Chop Canon!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.44,0:32:05.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Separate!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.32,0:32:13.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, runt, you wanna give up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.67,0:32:22.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.63,0:32:23.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.92,0:32:27.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Was I not supposed to scratch\Nyour face or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.93,0:32:29.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.26,0:32:33.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one damages my lucky hat\Nand walks away from it alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.51,0:32:34.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.72,0:32:36.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This hat is my only treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.52,0:32:40.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And anyone who so much as lays\Na finger on it is gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.48,0:32:42.32,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.32,0:32:43.82,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I made a solemn promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.82,0:32:45.69,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I promised the guy who gave me this hat
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.69,0:32:48.91,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,that I'd form a crew and become\Nthe greatest pirate ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.91,0:32:53.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I didn't think that there\Nwas anything that could faze him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.49,0:32:55.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.04,0:32:57.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's getting so upset about a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.83,0:33:04.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm... It seems that\Nhat has a history to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.00,0:33:05.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.51,0:33:07.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it really all that special?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.89,0:33:16.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If that's the case,\Nyou should protect it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.41,0:33:35.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll leave this hat to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.79,0:33:39.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It means more to me than anything in the world,\Nso you better take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.66,0:33:40.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.26,0:33:50.47,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I want you to bring\Nthis hat back to me someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.47,0:33:53.30,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,in good condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.30,0:33:56.26,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,And only once you've\Nbecome a great pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.26,0:33:58.52,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That's our promise, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.94,0:34:11.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You really consider this worthless\Ndirty straw hat a treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.49,0:34:14.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You need to grow up, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.87,0:34:16.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.91,0:34:19.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When Shanks gave me that,\NI made a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.04,0:34:20.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.25,0:34:23.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me that\Nthis used to be {\i1}Shanks'{\i0} hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.75,0:34:26.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No wonder it looked so familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.75,0:34:29.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He always wore it when I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.67,0:34:33.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you and Shanks were members\Nof the same pirate crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.01,0:34:36.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, back when we were\Npirates in training.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.47,0:34:38.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were fellow comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.72,0:34:42.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That damn detestable,\Nred-haired bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.85,0:34:46.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shanks is a much better\Nman then you'll ever be!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.48,0:34:48.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't have the right\Nto call him comrade!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.73,0:34:51.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And don't you ever bad-mouth him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.36,0:34:54.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Time for my Chop-Chop\NQuick Escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.20,0:35:03.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I don't want you to ever mention\NShanks' name to me again, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.50,0:35:09.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can say whatever the hell\NI want about Shanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.63,0:35:15.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what happened\Nbetween you and Shanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.22,0:35:16.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and where can I find him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.55,0:35:18.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.51,0:35:21.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you tear up my\Ntreasured straw hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.77,0:35:26.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you really wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.56,0:35:29.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's the one person that I loathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.77,0:35:33.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll curse his name\Nfor the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.57,0:35:37.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As long as there's\Nbreath in my body, Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.11,0:35:39.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will {\i1}never{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.03,0:35:41.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(1522,0,1,\c&H000000&)}...forgive you.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=90}===============================DIALOGUE============================
